        <mxCell id="guardrails" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#172033;fontSize=17;spacing=12;fontSize=15;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;Enforced guarantees&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Delivery checks actual tokens, quantity, deadline and price cap.&lt;br&gt;Tx/order hashes are audit references, not proof of historical trades.&lt;br&gt;Oracle resolution determines the payout; buying does not guarantee a win.&lt;br&gt;DAO withdrawals remain governed through the Timelock." vertex="1">
